{"4114320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bonkers Bum", "steam_appid": 4114320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world through the eyes of a bonkers bum who stumbled upon a strange artifact and start your journey between our world and its bright, insane, but yet disturbingly familiar reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No princesses to save, no honor or glory – this is not your story. You'll have to survive, explore dangerous streets, and find your way through chaos on your own strange way to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/f86532dd98a32216f7d02d180fc29c75.poster.avif?t=1769522381\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/f86532dd98a32216f7d02d180fc29c75.webm?t=1769522381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/f86532dd98a32216f7d02d180fc29c75.mp4?t=1769522381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bonkers Bum</i> is a side-scrolling adventure stealth-action game with a semi-open world, where your choices and survival skills determine the outcome. Explore a psychedelic universe, switch between worlds, and use safe zones to eat, rest, and craft everything you need for ongoing missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between worlds and use street-smart logic to defeat enemies, avoid traps and unpredictable challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the game with trusty shotgun at the ready or go stealth when it's possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft useful items and weapons using resources from both worlds and collect unique treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant comic-book-style world with absurd humor and a nostalgic '90s vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can survive alone or make new friends and travel with a little companion by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the environment and uncover hidden secrets in familiar streets and their acid-bright reflections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/e083ae826b03fb5756b39860e7bf8ccf.avif?t=1769522381\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world through the eyes of a bonkers bum who stumbled upon a strange artifact and start your journey between our world and its bright, insane, but yet disturbingly familiar reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No princesses to save, no honor or glory – this is not your story. You'll have to survive, explore dangerous streets, and find your way through chaos on your own strange way to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/f86532dd98a32216f7d02d180fc29c75.poster.avif?t=1769522381\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/f86532dd98a32216f7d02d180fc29c75.webm?t=1769522381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/f86532dd98a32216f7d02d180fc29c75.mp4?t=1769522381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bonkers Bum</i> is a side-scrolling adventure stealth-action game with a semi-open world, where your choices and survival skills determine the outcome. Explore a psychedelic universe, switch between worlds, and use safe zones to eat, rest, and craft everything you need for ongoing missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between worlds and use street-smart logic to defeat enemies, avoid traps and unpredictable challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the game with trusty shotgun at the ready or go stealth when it's possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft useful items and weapons using resources from both worlds and collect unique treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant comic-book-style world with absurd humor and a nostalgic '90s vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can survive alone or make new friends and travel with a little companion by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the environment and uncover hidden secrets in familiar streets and their acid-bright reflections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/e083ae826b03fb5756b39860e7bf8ccf.avif?t=1769522381\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p>", "short_description": "You're not a hero, but maybe this time, world needs someone like you. Explore a semi-open world, leap between two realities, gather loot, upgrade your shotgun at the base and destroy the enemies. This is a dangerous way, but if you survive, you will have a chance to save more than one reality.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Polish, Romanian, Russian<strong>*</s